      "source": [
        "<font color='blue'>[Fill in this markup cell with your predicted peak locations. The format doesn't have to be nice, but if you want the superscript for inverse wavenumbers, you would type $cm^{-1}$. You can see this in the entry part of the cell and copy-paste. The $ signs designate that the text inside is in Latex.]"
