    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Above is the base path in which the data is stored. The file format is \"/content/MSE7530/sampledata/plastics/known/XXX#.csv', in which the X's (may be 2 or 3) are the **string** corresponding to the polymer name, and the # is 1, 2, or 3 (since I added 3 spectra for each). For your polymer, enter the abbreviated name:"
